    <string name="cleanup_cancel">Cancel</string>
    <!--
      Was: "Deleted screenshots stay recoverable in Shelfie for 30 days."

      That was not true on this screen. Cleanup exists to reclaim storage, so it uses
      MediaStore.createDeleteRequest, which deletes the file outright — nothing is left
      to recover from, and there is no Recently Deleted screen to recover it in. The
      30-day window is real for the shelf's delete, which bins the file and offers an
      undo instead, but promising it here was telling people a bulk delete was
      reversible when it is the one place in the app that it is not.
    -->
    <string name="cleanup_recovery_note">Your phone will ask you to confirm. This frees the space straight away and cannot be undone.</string>

